  <Docs>
    <summary>Provides data for a SIP registration request that has been sent.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET event data class carries the argument from <see cref="M:Android.Net.Sip.ISipRegistrationListener.OnRegistering(System.String)" />. Its constructor stores the supplied value, and <see cref="P:Android.Net.Sip.RegisteringEventArgs.LocalProfileUri" /> returns it unchanged.</para>
      <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://github.com/dotnet/java-interop/blob/92b5d471f1e0f6164fc332b1f661b472f5cf3aad/tools/generator/SourceWriters/InterfaceEventArgsClass.cs">.NET event data generator</a></format>.</para>
